Well, I guess you don't need it since
.you don't hate vegetables anymore.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.490
I still hate vegetables.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:08.420
Didn't you eat a whole lot at the barbecue?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.820
Eggplants and green peppers and stuff.

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:13.890
That was just to get to the meat.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.100
I hope you didn't think I'd suddenly
.develop a taste for vegetables from that.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.180
You're so stubborn.

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:22.840
That's exactly why I want you
.to take on this challenge.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.950
I recorded that show for you!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.760
Interesting.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.370
I'll see right through this trick!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.530
Click.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.800
Whether you hate vegetables or love them, don't touch that dial!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:37.210
Everyone, together with me! Let's vegetable!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:42.780
Can you hear the vegetables' voices?

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:49.600
They're saying...

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.090
That's it, everyone!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.480
See you again!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.380
That was a pretty neat show.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:58.880
What do you think, Chiaki?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.800
Huh? I want to eat vegetables.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.230
It worked?!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.660
Kana, do we have any vegetables?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.180
Coming right up!

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.260
How about some vegetable sticks?

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.090
She's eating a carrot!
Chiaki, of all people!

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.440
And it's raw, too!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.760
H-How is it?

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:22.160
Keep it down.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:25.780
I'm trying to properly appreciate
.the carrot's rich sound and flavor.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.330
You're distracting me.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.610
O-Okay.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.430
It's delicious. Unbelievably delicious!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.560
Kana, bring me vegetables.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.270
More vegetables!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.340
I want more vegetables. Right now!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.110
Y-Yes.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:52.540
All right! It's lunchtime!

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:53.660
Hayami.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.020
I brought you a vegetable stick lunchbox.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.530
Enjoy.

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.160
Huh?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.920
Carrots, cucumbers,
celery, and even radishes.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.020
Enjoy it to your heart's content.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:06.780
No thanks.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.920
Don't hold back.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:10.430
Look how fresh they are!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.840
Here!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.360
Wh-What's wrong with you, Hosaka?

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.600
You're being way pushier than usual.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.560
And since when are
your lunches so simple?

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.740
Simple?

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:21.540
Yeah.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.820
How can you say that
about something so fresh?!

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:31.490
Wait!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.980
Wait, Hayami!

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.950
Eat my fresh vegetable stick!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.370
All you did was cut them!

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.390
Wait!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:44.980
Was that Hayami-senpai
and Hosaka-senpai?

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.530
I wonder what they're up to.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.480
There's nothing scary about vegetables!

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.720
<i>You're</i> the one who's scaring me!

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.390
Delicious.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.850
Let's eat vegetables together!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.400
Eat them on your own!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.640
Hey, Hayami-senpai.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:06.280
Oh, Hitomi!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.420
Great timing!

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:08.420
What's up?

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.840
Eat my...

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.990
vegetables!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:17.910
Well?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.940
It needs to taste more like a vegetable.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.370
It <i>was</i> a vegetable!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.770
More like a vegetable, huh?

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.960
I understand! The scales
have fallen from my eyes!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.010
Huh?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.840
Now that I look at them, there's
.something wrong with all their eyes.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.420
Vegetables should be more like vegetables.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.780
That'll be the theme for my next dish!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.290
Uh...

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.040
You two?

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.570
Let's eat vegetables!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.070
Cucumbers. Check.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.250
Green peppers. Check.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.320
Bitter melon. Check.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:57.780
Hmm...

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:57.790
That's the guy I saw when
.I came to shop that other time.
Hmm...

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:01.790
That's the guy I saw when
.I came to shop that other time.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.340
What's this?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:04.580
Turmeric?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.720
Jalapeños?

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:07.320
What <i>are</i> these things?

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.340
Yes, let's make curry.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.420
A super spicy one!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:15.020
Everything starts with the tumeric of love!

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:15.180
Oh, they're curry spices.
Everything starts with the tumeric of love!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:15.740
Oh, they're curry spices.

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:18.430
Jala-jala Jalapeño!
Oh, they're curry spices.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.410
Could that big guy be...

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.430
Can't go without...
Could that big guy be...

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:24.640
Yeah! He's the Curry Fairy!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:28.900
I thought eating vegetables
raw was the best way,

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.520
but it's still too early
.to draw a conclusion.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:35.600
The fairy is thinking
about vegetables today?

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.280
Cooking is my hobby.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.940
In my hands, vegetables will be more than just vegetables, and yet more <i>like</i> vegetables as well!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.950
I'll extract their true flavors!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:48.130
He's putting forth every effort to make vegetables
...more like vegetables, and thus even tastier...

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.100
He really is the Curry Fairy.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.710
I approve!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.380
Let's vegetable!

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:56.630
Vegetables are the best!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.400
Yeah!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.630
They're the best!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:08.100
Nonetheless, I require a different essence
.for my pursuit of vegetable mastery.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:11.530
Please try our free sausage samples!

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.280
Hmm...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.060
I'll have one.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:16.310
Here you go.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.740
I see.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.820
He intends to choose vegetables after refreshing his mouth!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.240
I'll take one.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.620
Here you go.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.200
This rich flavor spreading through my mouth!

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.000
This chewiness that inspires a sense of nostalgia!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:39.960
Delicious!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.820
Huh? What am I doing here?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.640
Huh? Why's there a bunch
.of vegetables in my basket?!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.800
Is this someone's idea of a joke?

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:51.140
I'll take a bag of them.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.980
Thank you.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:54.940
I'm home.

00:20:56.260 --> 00:21:00.200
Haruka-neesama, sausages
were on sale today.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:02.920
Haruka-neesama?

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.300
Chiaki, where are the vegetables?

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:06.120
What?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.480
I don't care about sausages.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:10.620
Where are the vegetables?

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.120
Haruka-neesama... don't tell me you...

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.540
Chiaki, let's eat vegetables.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.510
Vegetables!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.410
Let's vegetable!

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.660
All right! It's lunchtime!

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:32.640
Hayami.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:35.440
Ew. Don't tell me you made
.vegetable sticks again.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.680
I brought you a sausage lunchbox. Enjoy.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.170
Don't hold back.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.540
Sausages are great!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.030
Sausages are the best!

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:50.030
What happened to variety?!

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.090
Is that the Curry Fairy?

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.560
What's troubling him?

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.130
All right.

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:31.050
Next episode: "Love Begins Now."

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.850
What are you now, the Love Fairy?
